Linux kernel
============
How To Install (You must install custom rom with custom recovery first.
-Fastboot
fastboot --disable-verity --disable-verification flash vbmeta vbmeta.img
fastboot -w (Erase All Data)
fastboot reboot recovery
-Recovery
install touch-kernel-mojito-[version].zip
reboot to system

How To Build On Fedora
-Install Packages
sudo dnf install bc bison flex ccache clang lld llvm make openssl-devel ncurses-devel elfutils-libelf-devel gcc-c++ gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu gcc-arm-linux-gnu glibc-devel.i686 libgcc.i686 zip -y
git clone --depth=1 https://github.com/kdrag0n/proton-clang.git ~/proton-clang


-Setup Environment
export ARCH=arm64
export SUBARCH=arm64
export PATH="$HOME/proton-clang/bin:$PATH"
export CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu-
export CROSS_COMPILE_ARM32=arm-linux-gnu-
export CC=clang
export CFLAGS="-l/usr/include"
export LDFLAGS="-L/usr/lib64"

-Clean Workspace Output
make clean && make mrproper && rm -rf out

-Build Initial
make O=out CC=clang HOSTCC=clang HOSTCXX=clang++ vendor/mojito_defconfig

-Build Kernel
make -j$(nproc) O=out CC=clang HOSTCC=clang HOSTCXX=clang++ LD=ld.lld AR=llvm-ar NM=llvm-nm OBJCOPY=llvm-objcopy OBJDUMP=llvm-objdump STRIP=llvm-strip CROSS_COMPILE_ARM32=arm-linux-gnu- CROSS_COMPILE_COMPAT=arm-linux-gnu-

-Flash
Use Anykernel3 to flash
